  "bodyHash": "69562e1ed514dacf",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ut43Lym.png\" alt=\"标题\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/laser-bridges-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/776337?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flaser-bridges-and-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/laser-bridges-and-doors?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5NxocZK.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br>本模组引入了具有未来感的激光桥、门和栅栏，当激光源方块受到红石信号激活时便会生成。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C17yBiD.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br>它们的长度取决于红石信号的强度，并会实时动态更新。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VsMln86.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uFErCaY.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <br>你可以通过手持染料右键点击激光源方块进行染色，或者使用发射器为其染色。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VX4VIHg.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9qpoRLo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZ8J54O.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <br>在工作台中，将末影水晶放在正中央，周围放置玻璃块和7个铁锭即可合成激光源方块。将激光源方块放入工作台即可转换为激光栅栏源方块，该转换支持双向操作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>配置：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可以直接在游戏内配置此模组，或编辑个人资料文件夹中的JSON文件 <code>config/laserbridges.json</code>。若使用Fabric端且希望在游戏中直接修改配置，请安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>show_next_level</strong> - 由全强度红石信号驱动的激光源方块所生成的激光最大长度。其余长度均以此值为基准进行计算，默认值为15。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blocks_cut_through_by_lasers</strong> - 可被激光穿透（替换）的方块列表。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VMhMBQw.png\" height=\"400\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
